  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Based Coral Culture for Restoration, Conservation and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Contract with Reef Conservation following call for proposals EuropeAid/175592/DD/ACT/Multi (Strengthening CSOs and supporting their actions aiming at promoting Climate Actions, Good Governance, Gender equality and women, Girls and Youth Empowerment in both the Republic of Mauritius and the Republic of Seychelles). The action aims to create a land-based coral sanctuary (LBCS) for restoration, conservation, and education purposes in Mauritius.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
